#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:1
#: 1a0908194499436a9187e8fa6546ddb8
msgid "一分钟看懂数据集组成和分布"
msgstr "Understand Dataset Composition and Distributions in One Minute"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:3
#: 6df2bda5597c459591b09853f99e0aa9
msgid ""
"拿到陌生训练集时，先回答两个问题：数据由哪些组和元素组成，关键物理量是否有异常长尾。`Dataset summary` 给出总体组成，`Explore "
"distributions` 再把具体字段展开。"
msgstr ""
"For an unfamiliar training set, start with two questions: which groups and "
"elements are present, and whether important physical quantities have unusual"
" tails. `Dataset summary` shows the overall composition, while `Explore "
"distributions` examines individual fields."

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:5
#: 2294b2544fcb416fa1f0cb63c1573284
msgid "先看总体组成"
msgstr "Inspect the Overall Composition"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:7
#: 72f06093e18749d78b93e03f00d02d01
msgid "点击 `Dataset summary`。分组方式跟随顶部当前的搜索模式：选择 `Config_type` 时按配置类型统计，选择化学式时按化学式统计。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Dataset summary`. The grouping follows the current search mode at the"
" top: `Config_type` groups by configuration type, while the formula mode "
"groups by chemical formula."

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:9
#: f5e3e2c3d15745658b0be41b25f44686
msgid "数据集摘要窗口"
msgstr "Dataset summary dialog"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:9
#: f5e3e2c3d15745658b0be41b25f44686
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dataset_summary.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dataset_summary.png"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:14
#: 86bde113e0274780b2232ad93bf432ef
msgid ""
"本例共有 25 个活动结构、6250 个原子，Pb 和 Te 各占 50%，所有结构属于同一个 "
"`Config_type`。先在这里发现结构数、元素比例或分组数量不符合预期，再回头检查合并与导入步骤。"
msgstr ""
"This example contains 25 active structures and 6,250 atoms, with Pb and Te "
"each contributing 50%, and all structures sharing one `Config_type`. If the "
"structure count, element fractions, or group count are unexpected, inspect "
"the merge and import steps before continuing."

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:16
#: d3b65a11942b4e05a9d2d2d4b9f051bc
msgid "再看力等关键字段"
msgstr "Inspect Forces and Other Key Fields"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:18
#: da952f5c546e4045a8fce9947e89c2fa
msgid "打开 `Explore distributions`，选择数据字段、统计范围和分组方式。本例查看 `force`，按元素分组，并用力的模长作横坐标："
msgstr ""
"Open `Explore distributions` and choose a data field, scope, and grouping "
"mode. This example displays `force`, grouped by element, with force "
"magnitude on the horizontal axis:"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:20
#: 9d3b866e89414f86b50ca0fd25595586
msgid "按元素统计的原子力分布"
msgstr "Atomic-force distributions grouped by element"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:20
#: 9d3b866e89414f86b50ca0fd25595586
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/force_distribution.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/force_distribution.png"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:25
#: 53104544693e410f9d40ec72dada97aa
msgid "结果使用了全部 6250 个原子样本，可以直接比较 Pb、Te 的覆盖范围。还可以切换参考值、预测值或误差，用同样方法检查能量、应力和磁力等字段。"
msgstr ""
"The result uses all 6,250 atomic samples, making the coverage of Pb and Te "
"directly comparable. Switch among reference, prediction, and error data to "
"inspect energy, stress, magnetic force, and other fields in the same way."

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:27
#: 1e0abce2659a44a68982b3cec9a82a15
msgid "分布图只负责暴露覆盖和异常，不替你判断数据好坏。发现孤立尖峰、异常长尾或某个组明显偏移后，再回到主界面选中对应结构，结合几何和原始计算结果复核。"
msgstr ""
"A distribution plot reveals coverage and outliers; it does not decide "
"whether data are good or bad. When you find an isolated spike, unusual tail,"
" or shifted group, return to the main view, select the corresponding "
"structures, and review them together with their geometry and original "
"calculation output."
